  "details": "The respawn function is great for getting out of sticky moments, but besides whatever happens behind the scenes, it simply teleports you to spawn. I suggest it work like this:\n\nButton reworked into the Teleport button.\n\nIf World has no set \"teleport waypoints,\" clicking Teleport functions the same as respawn does now.\n\nIf the World you're in has these new waypoints set, clicking Teleport expands a menu with \"Teleport to Spawn\" and \"Teleport to (Waypoint name)\". Double clicking Teleport will instantly teleport to spawn as normal.",
